<title>JAPAN: UHT to change company rules to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>UHT to change company rules to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>UHT Corp said on Tuesday that it planned to change its company rules so that it would be able to buy back up to 500,000 of its own shares.</p>
<p>It plans to change the rules at its annual shareholders' meeting to be held on July 29, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>UHT makes air-pressure tools, piercing mills and other tools.</p>
